##Open the HTML file:
nano ~/bakery-app/index.html

##Modify the main heading:
<h2>Freshly Baked Happiness, Every Day.</h2>

For example, change it to:
<h2>Welcome to The Fairy Bake — Version 2!</h2>

Save the file.

##Build a new image:
cd ~/bakery-app
docker build -t fairy-bake:v2 .

##Load the new image into KIND:
kind load docker-image fairy-bake:v2 --name helm-lab

##Now update the Helm chart configuration:
nano ~/bakery-app/fairy-bake-chart/values.yaml

Change:
tag: "v1"
to:
tag: "v2"

Save the file.

##Upgrade the release:
helm upgrade fairy-bake ~/bakery-app/fairy-bake-chart

##Check the rollout:
kubectl rollout status deployment/YOUR_BAKERY_DEPLOYMENT_NAME

##Use the actual Deployment name from:
kubectl get deployments

##Refresh your browser:
http://localhost:8081

If the browser displays the old version, try a hard refresh and check the image used by the Deployment.
